        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/6b48ec846c816b7f112f4029041191f2.avif?t=1779814210\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>You’re not solving the mystery... you’re reliving it!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Artifact Protocol</i> is a first-person psychological horror game where every artifact traps you in the <strong>final moments of someone else’s life</strong>. You play as Anthony, an imprisoned ex-soldier forced into a classified testing program, promised freedom if you can survive. One by one, you’re sent into reconstructed memories of the dead, each trial a different nightmare.But the deeper you go, the less you’re sure if you’re living their memories… or your own. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>This isn't no ordinary horror... </strong>this is not a safe dream, it’s a trap built from tortured minds. Most who enter never return, <strong>even veteran horror fans have failed to survive even the first artifact... can you?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/ff3c2021382b0145c3ce7fbe4ac1b370.poster.avif?t=1779814210\" width=1170 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/ff3c2021382b0145c3ce7fbe4ac1b370.webm?t=1779814210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/ff3c2021382b0145c3ce7fbe4ac1b370.mp4?t=1779814210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What To Expect</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Five Nightmares In One:</strong> Each artifact is a standalone nightmare with its own setting, monster, and psychological theme.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Survival:</strong> Most who enter don’t escape the first artifact. No handholding, no walking simulator, only your wits and your will to survive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Voice Acting &amp; Story-Driven Experience:</strong> Every trial is brought to life with original voice performances and a narrative that unfolds through atmosphere, sound, and discovery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Environmental Storytelling</strong>: Learn each victim’s story through living it, not just watching it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adaptive Monster AI</strong>: No two encounters feel the same. Each creature learns, reacts, and hunts in its own terrifying way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/0eb6f42abf83e8a892f4d3e5e4c1b84b.poster.avif?t=1779814210\" width=1170 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/0eb6f42abf83e8a892f4d3e5e4c1b84b.webm?t=1779814210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/0eb6f42abf83e8a892f4d3e5e4c1b84b.mp4?t=1779814210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Replay Value Beyond the Main Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Completing the main story unlocks new layers of horror:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nightmare Mode: </strong>A brutal one-life challenge with a <strong>new &quot;Observer&quot;</strong> and <strong>exclusive</strong> narrative voice lines that reveal hidden lore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Challenge Gamemodes: </strong>Extra challenge trials that push your survival skills even further.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/16b3d5adc15db8d1e9cba4d3458e446a.poster.avif?t=1779814210\" width=1170 height=243 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/16b3d5adc15db8d1e9cba4d3458e446a.webm?t=1779814210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THEMES &amp; TONE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t about cheap jumpscares. <i>The Artifact Protocol</i> is built on <strong>dread, loss, and fractured identity</strong>... horror that lingers long after you’ve shut the game down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Artifact Protocol</strong> is designed as an intense horror experience you can survive in one sitting, with new modes and hidden story layers waiting to pull you back...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/c90e86614c9944dda25e81cad09f8a22.poster.avif?t=1779814210\" width=1170 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/c90e86614c9944dda25e81cad09f8a22.webm?t=1779814210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3763740/extras/c90e86614c9944dda25e81cad09f8a22.mp4?t=1779814210\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
